    "title": "Fatal Shooting at Salt Lake City Church",
    "text": "• A shooting occurred in the parking lot of a Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints meetinghouse in Salt Lake City.\n• Two people were killed in the shooting.\n• Several other people were injured.\n• A funeral was reportedly taking place inside the church building at the time of the shooting.\n• No suspect was in custody as of the report.\n• Emergency response vehicles were present at the scene.",
